<title>NETHERLANDS: TENNIS-AMSTERDAM OPEN SEMIFINAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-AMSTERDAM OPEN SEMIFINAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-08-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Semifinal results at the</p>
<p>Amsterdam Open men's tennis tournament on Saturday (prefix</p>
<p>number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Slava Dosedel (Czech Republic) beat Marcelo Filippini (Uruguay)</p>
<p>7-6 6-2</p>
<p>1-Carlos Moya (Spain) beat 4-Magnus Norman (Sweden) 6-4 6-3</p>
</text>
